               <p xml:id="idm172">Adolf Langsted, at the request of Hartmann in December 1887, sent him some information concerning those songs in the "Et Korstog. En religiøs-romantisk Digtning" (A Crusade. A Religious-Romantic Poem) which were specially suited for music. It was Langsted's wish that the songs should be ready in March, but Hartmann did not compose them until the summer of 1888.</p>
